{"id":"2b8f8c2d3844ca91","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence.md","title":"字符串与基项一步对应","display":"thm-string-trs-step-correspondence — 字符串与基项一步对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence","aliases":["56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence"],"display":"thm-string-trs-step-correspondence — 字符串与基项一步对应","depends_on":["[[56-df-string-trs-translation]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-ground-terms]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), correspondence stated after Example 3.4.10, printed p78","source_ocr_block":"99","verification_status":"source-claim-compared; local-correspondence-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-string-trs-step-correspondence — 字符串与基项一步对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac4f2389d6a4143b\" href=\"?note=ac4f2389d6a4143b\" title=\"56-df-string-trs-translation\">56-df-string-trs-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), correspondence stated after Example 3.4.10, printed p78"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"99"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-claim-compared; local-correspondence-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac4f2389d6a4143b\" href=\"?note=ac4f2389d6a4143b\" title=\"56-df-string-trs-translation\">56-df-string-trs-translation</a> 的有限字母表、非空左部规则、翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧\">\\(⟦-⟧\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_A\">\\(R_A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in A^*\">\\(u,v\\in A^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)\">\\(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)\\)</span> 的基项记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_A,V,R_A),\\qquad u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ u⟧\\to_{R_A}⟦ v⟧.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_A,V,R_A),\\qquad u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ u⟧\\to_{R_A}⟦ v⟧.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ u⟧=⟦ v⟧\\Longleftrightarrow u=v,\\qquad\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)=\\{⟦ w⟧:w\\in A^*\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ u⟧=⟦ v⟧\\Longleftrightarrow u=v,\\qquad\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)=\\{⟦ w⟧:w\\in A^*\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Example 3.4.10 对闭项片段“同构”的说明（印刷 p78，OCR 页块99）。若 u=plq，则归约位于前缀 p 后，尾变量实例化为 q 的一元项，得到 prq；反向由一元树的每个位置唯一确定一个串前缀。翻译单射和满射到闭项由串长/项高归纳。此结果不涵盖空左部规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-string-trs-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f2389d6a4143b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-string-trs-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-string-trs-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f2389d6a4143b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-string-trs-translation]] 的有限字母表、非空左部规则、翻译 $⟦-⟧$ 与 $R_A$。$u,v\\in A^*$。$\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)$ 的基项记号见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-string-trs-translation]] 的有限字母表、非空左部规则、翻译 $⟦-⟧$ 与 $R_A$。$u,v\\in A^*$。$\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)$ 的基项记号见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"⟦-⟧","display":false},{"tex":"R_A","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in A^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_A,V,R_A),\\qquad u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ u⟧\\to_{R_A}⟦ v⟧.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ u⟧=⟦ v⟧\\Longleftrightarrow u=v,\\qquad\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)=\\{⟦ w⟧:w\\in A^*\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-string-trs-step-correspondence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["ac4f2389d6a4143b","a3b60e1e9cdeef27","eccf433851609ffb"]}